# Platform 3.0 Modules & Locations

## Module Structure

```json
{
  "platform-version": "3.0",
  "modules": {
    "common": { /* Global locations */ },
    "product_module": { /* Product-specific */ }
  }
}
```

**Rules:**
1. MUST include ≥1 product module (even empty `{}`)
2. `common` for global placeholders only
3. Product modules for product-specific locations
4. Location MUST be in correct module

## Quick Module Reference

| Product | Primary Modules | Common Locations |
|---------|-----------------|------------------|
| **Freshdesk** | support_ticket, support_contact, support_company | ticket_sidebar, contact_sidebar, company_sidebar |
| **Freshservice** | service_ticket, service_asset, service_change | ticket_sidebar, asset_sidebar, change_sidebar |
| **Freshsales** | deal, contact, account, lead | deal_sidebar, contact_sidebar, account_sidebar, lead_sidebar |
| **Freshchat** | conversation, contact | conversation_sidebar, contact_sidebar |
| **Freshcaller** | call, contact | call_sidebar, contact_sidebar |

**Common (all products):** full_page_app, cti_global_sidebar

## Location Placement

| Location Type | Module | Example |
|---------------|--------|---------|
| Ticket sidebar | support_ticket / service_ticket | `modules.support_ticket.location.ticket_sidebar` |
| Contact sidebar | support_contact / contact | `modules.support_contact.location.contact_sidebar` |
| Full page app | common | `modules.common.location.full_page_app` |
| Deal sidebar | deal | `modules.deal.location.deal_sidebar` |

## Common Patterns

### Ticket Sidebar (Freshdesk)
```json
{
  "modules": {
    "support_ticket": {
      "location": {
        "ticket_sidebar": {
          "url": "index.html",
          "icon": "styles/images/icon.svg"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

### Full Page App (Any Product)
```json
{
  "modules": {
    "common": {
      "location": {
        "full_page_app": {
          "url": "index.html",
          "icon": "styles/images/icon.svg"
        }
      }
    },
    "support_ticket": {}
  }
}
```

### Multi-Module
```json
{
  "modules": {
    "common": {
      "location": { "full_page_app": {...} }
    },
    "support_ticket": {
      "location": { "ticket_sidebar": {...} }
    },
    "support_contact": {
      "location": { "contact_sidebar": {...} }
    }
  }
}
```

## Validation

| Error | Cause | Fix |
|-------|-------|-----|
| Location in wrong module | ticket_sidebar in common | Move to support_ticket |
| No product module | Only common declared | Add ≥1 product module |
| Invalid module name | ticket_details | Use support_ticket |
| Invalid location | ticket_page | Use ticket_sidebar |

